"角线方向移动速度更快."

msgid ""
"We can prevent that if we *normalize* the velocity, which means we set its "
"*length* to ``1``, and multiply by the desired speed."
msgstr ""
"如果我们对速度 进行 *归一化(normalize)* 处理, 就可以防止这种情况, 这意味着我"
