msgid "Using ImmediateGeometry"
msgstr "使用 ImmediateGeometry"

msgid ""
"Unlike the SurfaceTool or ArrayMesh, :ref:`ImmediateGeometry "
"<class_ImmediateGeometry>` is an actual node. Being a node makes it quick to "
