msgstr ""
"很少在Godot中直接使用导入的场景(它们要么实例化, 要么来自继承), 您可以将 "
"``AnimationTree`` 节点放置在包含导入的新场景中. 然后, 将 ``AnimationTree`` 节"
"点指向导入场景内创建的 ``AnimationPlayer`` 节点."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Here a new scene was created for the player with a ``KinematicBody`` as "
"root. Inside this scene, the original ``.dae`` (Collada) file was "
"instantiated and an ``AnimationTree`` node was created."
msgstr ""
"为玩家创建了一个以 ``KinematicBody`` 为根节点的新场景. 在这个场景中, 已实例化"
