"To change the import parameters of an asset in Rebel Editor (again, keep in "
"mind import parameters are only present in non-native Rebel resource types) "
"select the relevant resource in the filesystem dock:"
msgstr ""
"在Godot中更改资产的导入参数(再次提醒, 只有非本地的 Godot 资产类型有导入参"
"数), 只需在文件系统停靠面板中选择相关的资产:"

msgid ""
"Then, after adjusting the parameters, press \"Reimport\". These parameters "
