"when sources change."
msgstr "外部动画: 允许在源更改时, 修改和合并保存的动画."

msgid ""
"External scenes: Save each of the root nodes of the imported scenes as a "
"separate scene."
msgstr "外部场景: 将每个导入场景的根节点保存为单独的场景."

