#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Main Icon:** Provided main icon -> Project icon -> Default Rebel icon."
msgstr "**主图标：**\\ 提供的主图标 -> 项目图标 -> 默认 Godot 主图标。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Adaptive Icon Foreground:** Provided foreground icon -> Provided main icon "
