#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Adaptive Icon Background:** Provided background icon -> Default Rebel "
"background icon."
msgstr "**自适应图标背景：**\\ 提供的背景图标 -> 默认 Godot 背景图标。"

msgid ""
"It's highly recommended to provide all the requested icons with their "
