"可以求出第 2 步的位置。"

msgid ""
"Velocity measures the **change** in position per unit of time. The new "
"position is found by adding velocity to the previous position."
msgstr ""
"速度测量单位时间内位置的\\ **变化**\\ 。新的位置是通过在前一个位置上增加速度"
"来找到的。"

