msgid ""
"This means that any node can access a singleton named \"PlayerVariables\" "
"with:"
msgstr "这意味着，任何节点都可以访问并使用一个名为“PlayerVariables”的单例："

msgid ""
"If the **Enable** column is checked (which is the default), then the "
