"(如Blender)导入一个Mesh. 但是Godot也有一些 :ref:`PrimitiveMeshes "
"<class_primitivemesh>` 允许你在不导入Mesh的情况下为场景添加基本几何体."

msgid ""
"There are multiple node types that you can use to draw a mesh. The main one "
