"\"value\"}]JSON[/url]``"

msgid "Image vertical offset"
msgstr "图像垂直偏移"

msgid "You use a custom font for your image in order to align it vertically."
msgstr "您可以对图像使用自定义字体，以便将其垂直对齐。"

msgid "Create a ``BitmapFont`` resource"
msgstr "创建 ``BitmapFont`` 字体资源"

msgid ""
