"set to `1.4`, as the world was originally just a tad to big. As mentioned "
"earlier, keeping the scale relatively consistent is important in VR."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARVROrigin <class_ARVROrigin>` 节点是VR跟踪系统的中心"
"点. :ref:`ARVROrigin <class_ARVROrigin>` 的位置是VR系统认为的 \"中心\" 点在地"
"面上的位置. :ref:`ARVROrigin <class_ARVROrigin>` 有一个 `世界缩放` 属性, 影响"
