"将持续 ``0.75`` 秒. 我们需要知道这一点, 这样我们就可以在爆炸结束时移除炸"
"弹 :ref:`Particles <class_Particles>`."

msgid ""
"Let's write the code for the bomb. Select the ``Bomb`` :ref:`RigidBody "
"<class_RigidBody>` node and make a new script called ``Bomb.gd``. Add the "
